    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a professional cover letter in plain text format (no JSON).\n\nCandidate Name:{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Full Name'] }}\nEmail:{{ $('On form submission').item.json.Email }}\nJob Role:{{ $('JD Analyzer').item.json.output.job_title }}\nTarget Company:{{ $('JD Analyzer').item.json.output.company_name }}\nJob Description:{{ $('JD Analyzer').item.json.output }}\n\nResume Analysis:{{ $json.output }}\n\nWrite a compelling, personalized cover letter that:\n1. Highlights relevant skills from the resume\n2. Addresses the specific job requirements\n3. Shows enthusiasm for the role\n4. Is concise (300-400 words)\n5. Uses professional tone\n\nReturn ONLY the cover letter text, no JSON wrapper. ",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
